    {
      "id": "u_a70ba91896e3285b50e41cd3_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Indentation__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "a70ba91896e3285b50e41cd397c8344dfb318d7bbd7af150bad3c270cebab825",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2c8c3f21ab4283ae4ba53009_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Paragraphs can be indented using the following buttons from the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "2c8c3f21ab4283ae4ba530097ea88aabb6a318cfd5f116092d90af94fc016006",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_390520936439cbf7f0b877c7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to increase the indentation of the current paragraph by one. Can be pressed multiple times if needed.",
      "sourceHash": "390520936439cbf7f0b877c79bf1ce6f9df6f634ef9992c25bed9b6cc1f46a7e",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8e57d836716a012fcb1df975_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to decrease the indentation of a current paragraph. The button will be disabled if it is already at the minimum indentation level.",
      "sourceHash": "8e57d836716a012fcb1df9751285a73959253f15548479c7c1cad1c58826e2e3",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7a84874e061bc2fd19ae9172_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For convenience, keyboard shortcuts are also available. Press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_1__ to indent or __TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_5__ to decrease the indentation. These shortcuts work even if the cursor is not at the beginning of a paragraph or a list.",
      "sourceHash": "7a84874e061bc2fd19ae9172626fdf9ae5d4f35ed339e7f04f184b69827cfb70",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6d1b38b64de14f3e608188ff_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Apart from paragraphs, the indent button is also enabled in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Lists__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (for nesting) and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Tables__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "6d1b38b64de14f3e608188ffc6b9d1e088a9a6854ae243b2fc9e18454583ae5e",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b7de56f53d8b69a3274768aa_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When indented paragraphs or headings are copied and pasted as plain text, for example into a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Code__TRILIUM_PH_1__ note or another application, each indentation level becomes a tab at the start of the line. A copy that stays within a single paragraph contains only its text, without the indentation.",
      "sourceHash": "b7de56f53d8b69a3274768aa9ead5da42bd7ee9835a04079d55eb9ee0903288b",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_326c25ed479032b164801953_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The reverse also works: when plain text is pasted into a text note, each paragraph whose lines all start with tabs is indented by one level per tab. Pasting into a code block keeps the tabs as they are.",
      "sourceHash": "326c25ed479032b1648019536dd9beb0021527ceeb0260e47b43b3ad38494d97",
      "context": "Other features > Indentation",
      "contextHash": "0f00707dde397bc7c0cf8c869ea1b8dea036940e81f73a60a3b6101cf2a3da94",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8e2738bb6abcfb28e289a588_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Markdown import__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "8e2738bb6abcfb28e289a588e7631109efce180b3a1a0808f86eb55230225a68",
      "context": "Other features > Markdown import",
      "contextHash": "365a5b16c50a738af142e4136c246617dbe6263ba00519bec7a496830860f712",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c7aeaae5dfc14b5ade27b909_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If the clipboard contains Markdown text, it can be easily imported into text notes. Simply copy a Markdown-formatted text and press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to insert its visual representation.",
      "sourceHash": "c7aeaae5dfc14b5ade27b9092b930807bb55ab980d41217b77c5f39478fd06bc",
      "context": "Other features > Markdown import",
      "contextHash": "365a5b16c50a738af142e4136c246617dbe6263ba00519bec7a496830860f712",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b33d1fd6645ece27611752ab_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Note that this only works with raw Markdown (e.g. __TRILIUM_PH_0__ to generate a heading) and not the visual representation of the Markdown (e.g. as in the preview pane of an application). In that case, simply use the paste function which already accepts HTML-formatted content.",
      "sourceHash": "b33d1fd6645ece27611752abef109f1cabd12653afbf0b6a8cd06c5f39e41c17",
      "context": "Other features > Markdown import",
      "contextHash": "365a5b16c50a738af142e4136c246617dbe6263ba00519bec7a496830860f712",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_aa232fdc853c928f9394ab42_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is mostly useful for snippets of text, for entire Markdown documents use the dedicated __TRILIUM_PH_0__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_1__ import/export function.",
      "sourceHash": "aa232fdc853c928f9394ab421767974552b94aea5facf659659b5e6a2898ee9c",
      "context": "Other features > Markdown import",
      "contextHash": "365a5b16c50a738af142e4136c246617dbe6263ba00519bec7a496830860f712",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7182f1c2c08b706410986b20_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If accessing Trilium with a web browser, the Markdown import action will ask for the content to be inserted into a dedicated screen since it does not have access to the clipboard.",
      "sourceHash": "7182f1c2c08b706410986b2045b0cb46b7805627f8ee7e1a3caa058ffe9792b1",
      "context": "Other features > Markdown import",
      "contextHash": "365a5b16c50a738af142e4136c246617dbe6263ba00519bec7a496830860f712",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_92b1e4ff73e47bed57196871_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Cut to subnote__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "92b1e4ff73e47bed57196871188a5db88ded6dfac740695b2109ed29dfd91c3d",
      "context": "Other features > Cut to subnote",
      "contextHash": "701097cec693dab9fa2369887b8f740fc8c1e3adea1dce39e91c33ebf6548349",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0feedbf7bce9a538794a0dd5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button will create a child note with the selected text. For more information, see __TRILIUM_PH_1__Cut to subnote__TRILIUM_PH_2__.",
      "sourceHash": "0feedbf7bce9a538794a0dd5f88f25f8c8d5ae3f1a062b05cd823d45a6df8048",
      "context": "Other features > Cut to subnote",
      "contextHash": "701097cec693dab9fa2369887b8f740fc8c1e3adea1dce39e91c33ebf6548349",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5e9cf8798390f6841b12d72f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Find and replace__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "5e9cf8798390f6841b12d72f2b207ccbc854908e9393a074ce9a45145e4ec4dc",
      "context": "Other features > Find and replace",
      "contextHash": "15a4f8b89257b6fe56ebc47222d50848d7e9958d5509da1dd54b55775a01c556",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_16020f3d7986fa5df0ef2d22_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button will open the editor's dedicated search and replace functionality.",
      "sourceHash": "16020f3d7986fa5df0ef2d22bd033eda514b4dc3436bd0f7b6c7f7b6f3b63310",
      "context": "Other features > Find and replace",
      "contextHash": "15a4f8b89257b6fe56ebc47222d50848d7e9958d5509da1dd54b55775a01c556",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bc00d14c348d8fe80813b9c1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Alternatively, the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__F__TRILIUM_PH_3__ combination can be pressed to show the dialog.",
      "sourceHash": "bc00d14c348d8fe80813b9c155d2829885e7dcde8279d78e5665a2d786db2ab6",
      "context": "Other features > Find and replace",
      "contextHash": "15a4f8b89257b6fe56ebc47222d50848d7e9958d5509da1dd54b55775a01c556",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
